{
  "duration": 81.299,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.719,
      "end": 1.419,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.779,
      "end": 2.779,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.319,
      "end": 4.079,
      "text": "Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.599,
      "end": 6.639,
      "text": "we are given that a vehicle travels one hundred"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.159,
      "end": 8.34,
      "text": "twenty kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.84,
      "end": 10.5,
      "text": "at sixty kilometer per hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.039,
      "end": 12.399,
      "text": "then it travels another one hundred"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.699,
      "end": 13.599,
      "text": "eighty kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.099,
      "end": 15.759,
      "text": "at ninety kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.359,
      "end": 19.719,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the average speed for the complete journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.379,
      "end": 23.859,
      "text": "Average speed is equal to total distance divided by total time."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.34,
      "end": 24.799,
      "text": "So first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.159,
      "end": 27.599,
      "text": "let us find the time taken for each part of the journey."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.139,
      "end": 30.92,
      "text": "We know time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.359,
      "end": 32.139,
      "text": "For the first part,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.5,
      "end": 35.459,
      "text": "time is equal to one hundred twenty divided by sixty."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.939,
      "end": 38.279,
      "text": "This gives us two hours. For the second part,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.759,
      "end": 41.639,
      "text": "time is equal to one hundred eighty divided by ninety."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.139,
      "end": 43.539,
      "text": "This also gives us two hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.979,
      "end": 53.519,
      "text": "So the total time is equal to two plus two, four hours, and the total distance is equal to one hundred twenty plus one hundred eighty."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.039,
      "end": 56.839,
      "text": "That is equal to three hundred kilometers."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.34,
      "end": 58.5,
      "text": "Now we have everything we need."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.139,
      "end": 62.559,
      "text": "Average speed is equal to total distance divided by total time."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 63.879,
      "text": "Putting the values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.379,
      "end": 67.699,
      "text": "average speed is equal to three hundred divided by four."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.279,
      "end": 69.379,
      "text": "After simplifying this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.86,
      "end": 72.979,
      "text": "we get seventy-five kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.4,
      "end": 78.68,
      "text": "So the average speed for the complete journey is seventy-five kilometer per hour. Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.08,
      "end": 81.299,
      "text": "the correct answer is option D."
    }
